    skos:editorialNote "Curated classification (group=grp_drugs_medicinal_botanicals): Named materia medica (castoreum, ginseng, cubebs, scammony, maidenhair, liquorice juice, quassia, cocculus indicus, serpentary, asafoetida, cantharides, hellebore, pipsissewa, ipecacuanha) left in the residual bin. Layer-1 observations: 6 rows, 1800–1842. Series: KEW_CUST 5 ×4; KEW_CUST 4 ×1; CSP_Canadian_Exports_BlankSeries (inferred, series not printed) ×1. Units: CWTS (Hundredweights) ×5; Hundredweights.Quarters.Pounds ×1. Top routes: Holland → United Kingdom ×1; World → United Kingdom ×1; Germany → United Kingdom ×1; The Americas → United Kingdom ×1."@en ;
